    <summary>Self-hosted bot detection with 67 detectors, session vectors, and zero PII. Free forever.</summary>
    <description>StyloBot is a self-hosted bot defense proxy. Free forever.

67 detectors, sub-millisecond inference, 129-dimensional session vectors, intent classification, and reverse-proxy integration. One binary. No cloud dependency. Your traffic never leaves your perimeter.

Quick Start:
  stylobot 5080 http://localhost:3000
  stylobot 5080 http://localhost:3000 --policy block
  stylobot start 5080 http://localhost:3000 --tunnel
  stylobot dashboard hash-password
  stylobot man

Features:
- Sub-millisecond fast path detection (less than 1ms)
- 67 priority-ordered detector atoms with YAML manifests
- Dashboard view-authentication (config-credential + OIDC seam)
- 129-dim session vectors (Markov chains)
- LLM enrichment (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Groq, Ollama - any provider)
- Protocol fingerprinting (JA3/JA4, p0f, HTTP/2, QUIC)
- VPN/proxy detection (MaxMind Anonymous IP + ASN seeds)
- Real-time dashboard-style live detection table
- Content-cache for search engines + AI scraper Markdown extraction
- Cloudflare Tunnel support (--tunnel)
- Background daemon mode (start/stop/status/logs)
- Docker/K8s secrets support
- Zero PII architecture

Project site: https://github.com/scottgal/stylobot</description>
    <tags>bot-detection security waf reverse-proxy bot defense firewall proxy</tags>
